{"seq":1,"slug":"activity-retry-timeout","title":"Activity 重试、超时与取消传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/workers-activities/activity-retry-timeout","wordCount":1373,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"activity-重试-超时与取消传播\">Activity 重试、超时与取消传播</h1><p>Activity 是引擎里唯一&quot;可能跑很多次&quot;的部分，而重试策略与超时共同决定了它到底会跑几次、每次跑多久、什么时候放弃。这三个数字配错，轻则重复扣款，重则整个任务队列被重试风暴打满。本篇把 Temporal 的三种超时、RetryPolicy 的计算方式、心跳与取消传播拆开讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把四种时间限制分清楚——它们不是同一个东西的粗细粒度，而是在不同时钟上度量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超时类型</th>\n<th>从什么时刻起算</th>\n<th>度量什么</th>\n<th>触发后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>scheduleToCloseTimeout</code></td>\n<td>Activity 被调度（进历史）</td>\n<td><strong>整个 Activity 生命周期</strong>，含所有重试与排队</td>\n<td>不再重试，向 Workflow 返回超时失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>startToCloseTimeout</code></td>\n<td>某个尝试开始执行</td>\n<td><strong>单次尝试</strong>的最长执行时间</td>\n<td>该次尝试失败，按策略决定是否重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scheduleToStartTimeout</code></td>\n<td>被调度</td>\n<td>在队列中排队的最长时间</td>\n<td>该次尝试失败（通常意味着队列无 worker）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>heartbeatTimeout</code></td>\n<td>最后一次心跳</td>\n<td>距上次进度上报的间隔</td>\n<td>该次尝试失败，且<strong>记录心跳详情</strong>以支持快速重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四者的关系是一条不等式，写在文档里比记在脑子里可靠：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>单次尝试</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{startToClose} \\le t_{scheduleToStart} + t_{startToClose}\\ (\\text{单次尝试}) \\le t_{scheduleToClose}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">tT</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">tT</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次尝试</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>scheduleToClose</code> 是总闸门，它一到，无论还剩多少次重试都停止；<code>startToClose</code> 是每次尝试的闸门；<code>heartbeat</code> 是&quot;还活着&quot;的证据。只设前两者而不设心跳的后果是：一个卡死的 Activity 会一直占着 <code>startToClose</code> 的满额时间才被判失败，恢复速度慢一个数量级。另外要注意 <code>scheduleToStart</code> 触发的失败<strong>几乎总是配置问题而不是代码问题</strong>——它意味着任务在队列里没被领走，根因排查见<a href=\"task-queues\">任务队列路由与 worker 扩缩容</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Activity 被调度] --&gt; B[进入 Task Queue 排队]&#10;  B --&gt;|超 scheduleToStart| X1[尝试失败]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Worker 开始执行]&#10;  C --&gt;|超 startToClose| X1&#10;  C --&gt; D{定期 heartbeat}&#10;  D --&gt;|超 heartbeatTimeout 未上报| X1&#10;  D --&gt; E[正常完成]&#10;  X1 --&gt; F{RetryPolicy 判定}&#10;  F --&gt;|还在 scheduleToClose 内 且 未超最大尝试数| B&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[向 Workflow 返回失败]&#10;  E --&gt; H[结果写入历史]\">graph TD\n  A[Activity 被调度] --&gt; B[进入 Task Queue 排队]\n  B --&gt;|超 scheduleToStart| X1[尝试失败]\n  B --&gt; C[Worker 开始执行]\n  C --&gt;|超 startToClose| X1\n  C --&gt; D{定期 heartbeat}\n  D --&gt;|超 heartbeatTimeout 未上报| X1\n  D --&gt; E[正常完成]\n  X1 --&gt; F{RetryPolicy 判定}\n  F --&gt;|还在 scheduleToClose 内 且 未超最大尝试数| B\n  F --&gt;|否| G[向 Workflow 返回失败]\n  E --&gt; H[结果写入历史]</pre><h2 id=\"retrypolicy-的五个旋钮\">RetryPolicy 的五个旋钮</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const chargeActivity = proxyActivities&lt;typeof activities&gt;({&#10;  startToCloseTimeout: &#39;30 seconds&#39;,&#10;  scheduleToCloseTimeout: &#39;2 hours&#39;,&#10;  heartbeatTimeout: &#39;10 seconds&#39;,&#10;  retry: {&#10;    initialInterval: &#39;1 second&#39;,&#10;    backoffCoefficient: 2.0,&#10;    maximumInterval: &#39;5 minutes&#39;,&#10;    maximumAttempts: 8,&#10;    nonRetryableErrorTypes: [&#39;InvalidCardError&#39;, &#39;InsufficientFunds&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chargeActivity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> proxyActivities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activities>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  startToCloseTimeout: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 seconds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scheduleToCloseTimeout: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  heartbeatTimeout: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10 seconds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retry: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    initialInterval: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 second'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backoffCoefficient: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maximumInterval: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5 minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maximumAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nonRetryableErrorTypes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'InvalidCardError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'InsufficientFunds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用与取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>initialInterval</code></td>\n<td>1s</td>\n<td>首次重试延迟。太短会放大下游压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>backoffCoefficient</code></td>\n<td>2.0</td>\n<td>每次退避倍数。1.0 = 固定间隔，适合抢占式资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maximumInterval</code></td>\n<td>100 × initial</td>\n<td>退避上限，防止间隔膨胀到几小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maximumAttempts</code></td>\n<td>0（无限）</td>\n<td>必须显式设置，否则永远不会放弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nonRetryableErrorTypes</code></td>\n<td>空</td>\n<td>业务性失败（卡无效、余额不足）应该立刻失败而不是重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>退避间隔的闭式表达：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的等待时间为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>initial</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>coefficient</mtext><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> maximumInterval</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\min\\left(\\text{initial} \\times \\text{coefficient}^{\\,n-1},\\ \\text{maximumInterval}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2485em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">initial</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coefficient</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">maximumInterval</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加上 0–1 之间的随机抖动（Temporal 对间隔施加 ±10% 左右的抖动以避免同步重试）。举例：initial=1s、coefficient=2、maximum=5min 时，序列是 1s、2s、4s、8s、16s、32s、64s、128s、256s、300s、300s…，8 次尝试的总跨度约 10 分钟；若 <code>scheduleToClose</code> 设为 2 小时，两者谁先到谁生效。</p>\n<p><strong>最常见的两个配置错误</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>maximumAttempts</code> 留空（无限重试）+ <code>scheduleToClose</code> 也很长</strong>，于是一个永久性失败的下游被无限重试直到总闸门，期间持续消耗 task slot。</li>\n<li><strong>把业务性失败也设成可重试</strong>。<code>InvalidCard</code> 重试 8 次不会变成有效卡，只会让用户多等 10 分钟。所有&quot;重试也不会成功&quot;的错误都应进 <code>nonRetryableErrorTypes</code>——这要求 Activity 抛出的错误类型本身是可分类的。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"心跳-进度-详情与取消的载体\">心跳：进度、详情与取消的载体</h2><p>心跳不只是&quot;我还活着&quot;的 ping，它有三重职责：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Context } from &#39;@temporalio/activity&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function syncBatch(ids: string[]): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  let done = 0;&#10;  for (const id of ids) {&#10;    if (Context.current().cancelled) {&#10;      // 检查取消&#10;      throw new CancelledFailure(&#39;cancelled by workflow&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    await syncOne(id);&#10;    done += 1;&#10;    Context.current().heartbeat({ done, total: ids.length }); // 上报进度&#10;  }&#10;  return done;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Context } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/activity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> syncBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ids) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().cancelled) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 检查取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CancelledFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled by workflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> syncOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">heartbeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ done, total: ids.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上报进度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ol>\n<li><strong>保命</strong>：超时未上报即判定该次尝试失败。</li>\n<li><strong>传进度</strong>：<code>heartbeat(details)</code> 的详情会记录在服务端，重试时可以读取——<code>Context.current().heartbeatDetails</code>。这让一个 3 小时的批量任务能在崩溃后从第 4700 个而不是第 0 个继续。</li>\n<li><strong>传取消</strong>：<code>Context.current().cancelled</code> 是当前尝试是否被请求取消的确定性视图；<code>heartbeat()</code> 在被取消时会抛出 <code>CancelledFailure</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>配合心跳详情做断点续传是长任务的标准写法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export async function syncBatchResumable(ids: string[]): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  const prior = Context.current().heartbeatDetails as { done: number } | undefined;&#10;  const start = prior?.done ?? 0;&#10;  let done = start;&#10;  for (const id of ids.slice(start)) {&#10;    await syncOne(id);&#10;    done += 1;&#10;    Context.current().heartbeat({ done });&#10;  }&#10;  return done;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> syncBatchResumable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().heartbeatDetails </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">done</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prior?.done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ids.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> syncOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">heartbeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ done });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意心跳详情<strong>只在同一次 Activity 的重试之间传递</strong>（同一 <code>activityId</code>），跨 Activity 调用不共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取消传播-从-workflow-到真实线程\">取消传播：从 Workflow 到真实线程</h2><p>取消在 Temporal 里是<strong>协作式</strong>的：Workflow 发出取消请求，Server 记录 <code>ActivityTaskCancelRequested</code>，Activity Worker 在下次心跳时收到通知并把 <code>cancelled</code> 置真。它不会强杀你的线程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export async function orderWorkflow(order: Order): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const scope = new CancellationScope(); // 可独立取消的作用域&#10;  const shipping = scope.run(() =&gt; arrangeShipping(order));&#10;  const paid = await collectPayment(order); // 若这里抛错&#10;  if (!paid.ok) {&#10;    scope.cancel(); // 取消发货&#10;    await shipping.catch(() =&gt; {}); // 等它真正停下&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orderWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CancellationScope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可独立取消的作用域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shipping</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> arrangeShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> collectPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 若这里抛错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">paid.ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scope.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 取消发货</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipping.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等它真正停下</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>清单式要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Workflow 侧</strong>：用 <code>CancellationScope</code> 显式界定&quot;哪些调用一起被取消&quot;，取消后要 <code>await</code> 被取消的 Promise 以确保清理完成，否则 cleanup Activity 可能在主流程结束后才跑。</li>\n<li><strong>Activity 侧</strong>：必须在循环里主动检查 <code>cancelled</code> 或依赖 <code>heartbeat</code> 抛错；纯 CPU 的紧循环不检查就永远感知不到取消。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;取消&quot;不是&quot;回滚&quot;</strong>：被取消的 Activity 可能已经写了部分数据。清理是用补偿 Activity 完成的，而补偿 Activity 本身也会重试、也可能重复执行，因此它同样需要幂等设计（见<a href=\"idempotency-side-effects\">副作用幂等与外部系统对接</a>）。本 hub 只负责把取消信号送到位。</li>\n<li><strong><code>ActivityTaskCanceled</code> 事件会进历史</strong>，所以&quot;取消&quot;本身是可重放、可审计的。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant WF as Workflow&#10;  participant S as Temporal Server&#10;  participant AW as Activity Worker&#10;  WF-&gt;&gt;S: 请求取消 Activity&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;S: 写 ActivityTaskCancelRequested&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 下次心跳响应携带取消标记&#10;  AW-&gt;&gt;AW: cancelled = true&#10;  AW-&gt;&gt;AW: 循环内检查 → throw CancelledFailure&#10;  AW--&gt;&gt;S: 尝试失败(取消)&#10;  S--&gt;&gt;WF: 返回 CancelledFailure&#10;  Note over WF: 决定补偿或走替代分支\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant WF as Workflow\n  participant S as Temporal Server\n  participant AW as Activity Worker\n  WF-&gt;&gt;S: 请求取消 Activity\n  S-&gt;&gt;S: 写 ActivityTaskCancelRequested\n  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 下次心跳响应携带取消标记\n  AW-&gt;&gt;AW: cancelled = true\n  AW-&gt;&gt;AW: 循环内检查 → throw CancelledFailure\n  AW--&gt;&gt;S: 尝试失败(取消)\n  S--&gt;&gt;WF: 返回 CancelledFailure\n  Note over WF: 决定补偿或走替代分支</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种超时 + 心跳各管一段时钟：<code>startToClose</code> 管单次尝试，<code>scheduleToClose</code> 管总生命周期，<code>scheduleToStart</code> 管排队，<code>heartbeat</code> 管存活性。</li>\n<li>退避间隔由 initial/coefficient/maximum 三者决定，公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>initial</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mtext>coef</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>max</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n=\\min(\\text{initial}\\cdot\\text{coef}^{n-1},\\text{max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">initial</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1484em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coef</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并带随机抖动。</li>\n<li><code>maximumAttempts</code> 必须显式设置；业务性失败必须放进 <code>nonRetryableErrorTypes</code>。</li>\n<li>心跳三重职责：保命、传进度详情、传取消；详情只在同一 Activity 的重试间传递。</li>\n<li>取消是协作式的，Activity 必须主动检查；取消不等于回滚，清理靠补偿。</li>\n<li>长任务的标准形状是&quot;心跳上报进度 + 从 <code>heartbeatDetails</code> 恢复&quot;，让每次尝试都从断点继续。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Activity 重试、超时与取消传播","id":"activity-重试-超时与取消传播"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RetryPolicy 的五个旋钮","id":"retrypolicy-的五个旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"心跳：进度、详情与取消的载体","id":"心跳-进度-详情与取消的载体"},{"level":2,"text":"取消传播：从 Workflow 到真实线程","id":"取消传播-从-workflow-到真实线程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Workflow 与 Activity 的边界划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/durable-execution/activity-boundary"},"next":{"title":"任务队列路由与 worker 扩缩容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/workers-activities/task-queues"}}